<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }} notes={`Grad-CAM 热图落在肺野，不在四边。定量上边框响应 0.382，而边框面积本身占 0.490，比值 0.78，小于 1，说明注意力偏中央。这个指标必须和面积一起报，否则 0.382 会被误读。在自己数据上没作弊，换一家医院呢？`}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>可解释性：模型关注的是肺野而非边缘</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F2' }}>12 · Explainability</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 54 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            以最后一层卷积的梯度为权重，对特征图加权后上采样回 28×28，得到判为肺炎时的关注度分布（Grad-CAM）。
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
            <Image src='assets/gradcam.png' style={{ width: 880, height: 372, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, marginTop: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 370, borderTop: '2px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>0.382</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>边框（4 像素环）响应占比</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 370, borderTop: '2px solid #1E4FA8', paddingTop: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>0.490</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>边框面积占比（随机基线）</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 370, borderTop: '2px solid #D9534F', paddingTop: 8, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 28, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>0.78 ×</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>响应占比 ÷ 面积占比，小于 1 表示偏中央</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>
                未发现依赖黑边或体位标记的证据；<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>比例型指标必须与面积占比同时报告</span>，否则 0.382 会被误读。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>MedMNIST 医学影像分类调参实验室 · 中期验收</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>12 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
